OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMostly dry today with plenty of
OL,6,Fsunny spells and lighter winds than of
OL,7,Flate. However, some cloud will bubble
OL,8,Fup during the day, giving a very small
OL,9,Fchance of the odd light shower.
OL,10,FFeeling pleasant in the sunshine.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA fine evening with some late
OL,13,Fsunshine. Skies will cloud over after
OL,14,Fdark though, with some showery
OL,15,Foutbreaks of rain arriving overnight.
OL,16,FA mild night, though a southerly
OL,17,Fbreeze developing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
