OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FOutbreaks of showery clearing
OL,6,Fduring the morning, the rain perhaps
OL,7,Flocally heavy early on. Dry and rather
OL,8,Fwarm in the afternoon with some bright
OL,9,Fspells. Cloudier in the west later.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,12,FUnsettled at first with spells of
OL,13,Fshowery rain at times and brisk winds.
OL,14,FSettling down for Wednesday, with
OL,15,Fspells of sunshine and temperatures
OL,16,Faround the seasonal average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
